            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, justice Scalia questioned whether the parties wanted to pay pre\u2011judgment interest."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "14c45a11a5c2f9572bc1612451fff19287d2fd6cb53153241dd44e9c4c075b88",
            "evidence_ids": [
