  "why_it_matters": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "National Park Hospitality Association",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "14c45a11a5c2f9572bc1612451fff19287d2fd6cb53153241dd44e9c4c075b88",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-14c45a11a5c2-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "14c45a11a5c2f9572bc1612451fff19287d2fd6cb53153241dd44e9c4c075b88",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-14c45a11a5c2-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to National Park Hospitality Association, the petitioner argues that determining whether the CDA applies is important for concessioners to know their rights when deciding whether and how much to bid on a contract."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Geller",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "14c45a11a5c2f9572bc1612451fff19287d2fd6cb53153241dd44e9c4c075b88",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-14c45a11a5c2-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "14c45a11a5c2f9572bc1612451fff19287d2fd6cb53153241dd44e9c4c075b88",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-14c45a11a5c2-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Geller, the petitioner emphasizes that they need to know now whether they can challenge the regulation and contract terms, which affects their bidding decisions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "14c45a11a5c2f9572bc1612451fff19287d2fd6cb53153241dd44e9c4c075b88",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-14c45a11a5c2-0003-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 61
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Government, the Government asserts that it is the sole beneficiary of contractual provisions requiring construction, repair, and maintenance of facilities in the national parks."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Congress",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "14c45a11a5c2f9572bc1612451fff19287d2fd6cb53153241dd44e9c4c075b88",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-14c45a11a5c2-0003-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Congress, congress, in enacting the 1998 act, indicated that concession contracts were not intended to be procurement contracts."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
